WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.102
- My mother was a witch.

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.436
And I know that I said my
favorite of her sayings

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.505
was the one about the
bloated monk who feared

00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.107
his vow of silence
covered farts,

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.008
but I didn't have a
way with the phrase.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.410
I'm afraid that
I'll word it wrong.

00:00:10.477 --> 00:00:12.912
Tell it another
time, [inaudible]..

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:15.281
The woods reward silence.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:18.118
It is in the silence we hear
things not of this world.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.323
Now, I will show you.

00:00:29.229 --> 00:00:33.099
You must step very carefully.

00:00:33.166 --> 00:00:34.901
Here to here.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:54.354
Are you nervous of
what you will find

00:00:54.421 --> 00:00:56.156
when you reach [inaudible]?

00:00:58.792 --> 00:00:59.526
Perhaps.

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.669
Which means you [inaudible]
as surprise as [inaudible]..

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:11.771
[gasps]

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:12.605
Ah.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:18.478
[laughs] It's fine.

00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:25.185
[sighs]

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:30.757
They are everywhere on
[inaudible] this time of year.

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:35.295
And there are mice, of
course, many hawks, which also

00:01:35.361 --> 00:01:38.665
eat the mice but prefer
to eat the snakes

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.333
and sometimes get both.

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:48.942
There is also another
creature, the [inaudible]..

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:52.612
The child of my
housekeeper, Mary.

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:56.049
This is one of the surprises
I will warn you of now.

00:01:56.115 --> 00:01:57.851
You have a housekeeper?

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.286
I depend on her as she
is a [inaudible] woman.

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:01.721
And she may test you.

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.023
She may throw curses at you.

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:07.327
Then you must put
her in her place.

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:11.331
She has long since forgotten
her place, I'm afraid.

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:12.365
Come.

00:02:12.432 --> 00:02:14.334
I will tell you the
story of the wasp

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:15.768
that followed me for two days.

00:02:19.739 --> 00:02:20.306
Yes.

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:21.374
I looked and saw--

